Does he like like music? Ela gosta de musica?:
Does he work at school? Ela trabalha na escola?
Does he play video games? ela joga video game?

## She 
Does she live in Brazil? Ela mora/vive no Brasil ?
Does she study every day? Ela estuda todo dia?
Does she like cats ? Ela gosta de gatos?

## It 

Does It work  will? Isso funciona bem?
Does It need water ? Isso precisa de agua?
